#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "2.1 Defining the transverse-field Ising Hamiltonian {#21-defining-the-transverse-field-ising-hamiltonian}"
msgstr "2.1 横磁場イジングハミルトニアンの定義 {#21-defining-the-transverse-field-ising-hamiltonian}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "We here consider the 1-D transverse-field Ising model.\n"
msgstr "ここでは 1 次元横磁場イジングモデルを考えます。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "First, we will create a function that takes in the system parameters $N$, $J$, $h$ and $\\alpha$, and returns our Hamiltonian as a `SparsePauliOp`. A [SparsePauliOp](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.quantum_info.SparsePauliOp) is a sparse representation of an operator in terms of weighted [Pauli](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.quantum_info.Pauli) terms.\n"
msgstr "まず、システムパラメータ $N$、$J$、$h$、$\\alpha$ を受け取り、ハミルトニアンを `SparsePauliOp` として返す関数を作成します。[SparsePauliOp](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.quantum_info.SparsePauliOp) は、重み付き[パウリ](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.quantum_info.Pauli)項を用いた演算子のスパース表現です。\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "Define the Hamiltonian {#define-the-hamiltonian}"
msgstr "ハミルトニアンの定義 {#define-the-hamiltonian}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The system that we now consider has a size of $N=6$, $J=0.2$, $h=1.2$ and $\\alpha=\\frac{\\pi}{8.0}$ as an example.\n"
msgstr "ここでは例として、サイズ $N=6$、$J=0.2$、$h=1.2$、$\\alpha=\\frac{\\pi}{8.0}$ のシステムを考えます。\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "2.2 Set the parameters of the time-evolution simulation {#22-set-the-parameters-of-the-time-evolution-simulation}"
msgstr "2.2 時間発展シミュレーションのパラメータ設定 {#22-set-the-parameters-of-the-time-evolution-simulation}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Here we will consider three different Trotterization techniques:\n"
"* Lie–Trotter (first order)\n"
"* second-order Suzuki–Trotter\n"
"* fourth-order Suzuki–Trotter\n"
msgstr ""
"ここでは、3 種類のトロッタリゼーション手法を考えます：\n"
"* Lie–Trotter（一次）\n"
"* 二次 Suzuki–Trotter\n"
"* 四次 Suzuki–Trotter\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The latter two will be used in the exercise, and in the appendix.\n"
msgstr "後の二つは演習と付録で使用します。\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "2.3 Prepare the quantum circuit 1 (Initial state) {#23-prepare-the-quantum-circuit-1-initial-state}"
msgstr "2.3 量子 Circuit の準備 1（初期状態） {#23-prepare-the-quantum-circuit-1-initial-state}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Create an initial state. Here we will start with a spin configuration of $\\uparrow\\uparrow\\downarrow\\downarrow\\uparrow\\uparrow$\n"
".\n"
msgstr "初期状態を作成します。ここでは $\\uparrow\\uparrow\\downarrow\\downarrow\\uparrow\\uparrow$ のスピン配置から始めます。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![Output of the previous code cell](/learning/images/courses/utility-scale-quantum-computing/quantum-simulation/extracted-outputs/b338806d-67bf-47ae-9d03-944bde3e2c99-0.avif)\n"
msgstr "![Output of the previous code cell](/learning/images/courses/utility-scale-quantum-computing/quantum-simulation/extracted-outputs/b338806d-67bf-47ae-9d03-944bde3e2c99-0.avif)\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "2.4 Prepare the quantum circuit 2 (Single circuit for time evolution) {#24-prepare-the-quantum-circuit-2-single-circuit-for-time-evolution}"
msgstr "2.4 量子 Circuit の準備 2（時間発展の単一 Circuit） {#24-prepare-the-quantum-circuit-2-single-circuit-for-time-evolution}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "We here construct a circuit for a single time step using Lie–Trotter.\n"
msgstr "ここでは Lie–Trotter を用いて、単一タイムステップの Circuit を構築します。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The Lie product formula (first-order) is implemented in the [LieTrotter](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.synthesis.LieTrotter) class. A first-order formula consists of the approximation stated in the introduction, where the matrix exponential of a sum is approximated by a product of matrix exponentials:\n"
msgstr "Lie 積公式（一次）は [LieTrotter](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.synthesis.LieTrotter) クラスで実装されています。一次公式は、はじめに述べた近似から成り、和の行列指数関数を行列指数関数の積で近似します：\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"e^{H_1+H_2} \\approx e^{H_1} e^{H_2}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"e^{H_1+H_2} \\approx e^{H_1} e^{H_2}\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "As previously mentioned, very deep circuits lead to the accumulation of errors, and cause problems for modern quantum computers. Because two-qubit gates have higher error rates than single-qubit gates, a quantity of particular interest is the two-qubit circuit depth. What really matters is the two-qubit circuit depth after transpilation (since that is the circuit the quantum computer actually executes). But let us get in the habit of counting the operations for this circuit, even now using the simulator.\n"
msgstr "前述のとおり、非常に深い Circuit は誤差の蓄積を招き、現代の量子コンピュータにとって問題となります。2 qubit ゲートは 1 qubit ゲートよりもエラー率が高いため、特に注目すべき指標は 2 qubit Circuit の深さです。実際に重要なのはトランスパイル後の 2 qubit Circuit の深さです（量子コンピュータが実際に実行するのはそのCircuitだからです）。しかし、今はシミュレータを使う段階でも、この Circuit の演算数を数える習慣をつけておきましょう。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![Output of the previous code cell](/learning/images/courses/utility-scale-quantum-computing/quantum-simulation/extracted-outputs/252c2734-653d-4c8e-af6b-d3173845de88-1.avif)\n"
msgstr "![Output of the previous code cell](/learning/images/courses/utility-scale-quantum-computing/quantum-simulation/extracted-outputs/252c2734-653d-4c8e-af6b-d3173845de88-1.avif)\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "2.5 Set the operators to measure {#25-set-the-operators-to-measure}"
msgstr "2.5 測定する演算子の設定 {#25-set-the-operators-to-measure}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Let us define a *magnetization operator* $\\sum_i \\langle Z_i \\rangle / N$, and a *mean spin correlation operator* $\\sum_i \\langle Z_i Z_{i+1} \\rangle/ (N - 1)$.\n"
msgstr "*磁化演算子* $\\sum_i \\langle Z_i \\rangle / N$ と *平均スピン相関演算子* $\\sum_i \\langle Z_i Z_{i+1} \\rangle/ (N - 1)$ を定義します。\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "2.6 Perform time-evolution simulation {#26-perform-time-evolution-simulation}"
msgstr "2.6 時間発展シミュレーションの実行 {#26-perform-time-evolution-simulation}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
